馬，内史匍匐。綰無他腸，塞有陰德。刑名張歐，垂涕恤獄。敏行訥言，倶嗣芳躅。"}],"rationale":"依本篇姓名、稱號、名歐及名仁等明示與敘事承接判讀；來源原字保留，未自動跨篇同名合併。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[{"id":"eq-shiji112-core-zhangou","person_ids":["afj_vl8_7fu_A"],"canonical_person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional","scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-112-pingjin","c-shiji-103-wanshi"],"rationale":"本篇御史大夫張歐免與萬石張叔列傳名歐、武帝朝御史大夫相合，暫同指張歐。卷112元朔三年免、卷103元朔四年拜原文敘年互不順接，身份接合不裁成同一年或改任期，不新增父親；安丘侯之子來源仍按本傳明言。","evidence":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin","source_id":"s-shiji112-pingjin","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p005","quote":"元朔三年，張歐免，以弘為御史大夫。是時通西南夷，東置滄海，北筑朔方之郡。弘數諫，以為罷敝中國以奉無用之地，願罷之。於是天子乃使朱買臣等難弘置朔方之便。發十策，弘不得一。弘乃謝曰：「山東鄙人，不知其便若是，願罷西南夷、滄海而專奉朔方。」上乃許之。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0005"],"text_layer":"received_chapter"},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi","paragraph_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p024","quote":"御史大夫張叔者，名歐，安丘侯説之庶子也。孝文時以治刑名言事太子。然歐雖治刑名家，其人長者。景帝時尊重，常爲九卿。至武帝元朔四年，韓安國免，詔拜歐爲御史大夫。自歐爲吏，未嘗言案人，專以誠長者處官。官屬以爲長者，亦不敢大欺。上具獄事，有可卻，卻之；不可者，不得已，爲涕泣面對而封之。其愛人如此。","mention_ids":["c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0004","c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0009","c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0033","c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0071","c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0079"],"text_layer":"received_chapter"}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"references":[{"title":"《史記集解》卷一百十二（文淵閣數位見證）","url":"https://github.com/kanripo/KR2a0002/blob/73c4d2ba067d99a6de924ac952fd6921a958c7e7/KR2a0002_112.txt#L35-L38","quote":"元朔三年張歐免以𢎞為御史大夫","raw_quote":"謝曰夫知臣者以臣為忠不知臣者以臣為不忠上然¶\n𢎞言左右幸臣每毁𢎞上益厚遇之元朔三年張歐免¶\n以𢎞為御史大夫是時通西南夷東置滄海北築朔方¶\n之郡𢎞數諌以為罷敝中國以奉無用之地願罷之於¶","scope":"received_parallel_chronology","image_verified":false,"response_sha256":"de88857d7f20adc1e00bab586fae19c8615df68c55e592d243dc9b9b9a95f1e4","source_blob_sha":"2b465e6a1b6b48328814f030dbba777e2a916cff","note":"短引文只除排版括號、換行、小注斜線、段末符與頁標；raw_quote保留原片段。古注轉引他書不當親讀該本，未核書影。"}],"identity_materialized":true}],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p024","text":"御史大夫張叔者，名歐，安丘侯説之庶子也。孝文時以治刑名言事太子。然歐雖治刑名家，其人長者。景帝時尊重，常爲九卿。至武帝元朔四年，韓安國免，詔拜歐爲御史大夫。自歐爲吏，未嘗言案人，專以誠長者處官。官屬以爲長者，亦不敢大欺。上具獄事，有可卻，卻之；不可者，不得已，爲涕泣面對而封之。其愛人如此。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0004","start":4,"end":6,"surface":"張叔","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0009","start":9,"end":10,"surface":"歐","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0011","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"安丘侯説","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"太子","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"歐","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0057","start":57,"end":59,"surface":"武帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0064","start":64,"end":67,"surface":"韓安國","kind":"person","person_id":"6hy_i1z_hu2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0071","start":71,"end":72,"surface":"歐","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m024-0079","start":79,"end":80,"surface":"歐","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","book_id":"b-shiji-103","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p026","text":"太史公曰：仲尼有言曰「君子欲訥於言而敏於行」，其萬石、建陵、張叔之謂邪？是以其教不肅而成，不嚴而治。塞侯微巧，而周文處讇君子譏之，爲其近於佞也。然斯可謂篤行君子矣！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m026-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"太史公","kind":"person","person_id":"nz6_tdl_ub1","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m026-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"fp6_ia6_7yw","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m026-0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"萬石","kind":"person","person_id":"esh_e0a_jrw_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m026-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"張叔","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m026-0056","start":56,"end":58,"surface":"周文","kind":"person","person_id":"2jn_tjp_75n","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","book_id":"b-shiji-103","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:p027","text":"萬石孝謹，自家形國。郎中數馬，内史匍匐。綰無他腸，塞有陰德。刑名張歐，垂涕恤獄。敏行訥言，倶嗣芳躅。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"witness_appended_suoyin_zan","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m027-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"萬石","kind":"person","person_id":"esh_e0a_jrw_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m027-0020","start":20,"end":21,"surface":"綰","kind":"person","person_id":"113_odk_emq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi:m027-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"張歐","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-103-wanshi","book_id":"b-shiji-103","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-103-wanshi"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:p005","text":"元朔三年，張歐免，以弘為御史大夫。是時通西南夷，東置滄海，北筑朔方之郡。弘數諫，以為罷敝中國以奉無用之地，願罷之。於是天子乃使朱買臣等難弘置朔方之便。發十策，弘不得一。弘乃謝曰：「山東鄙人，不知其便若是，願罷西南夷、滄海而專奉朔方。」上乃許之。","annotation_status":"in_progress","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"張歐","kind":"person","person_id":"afj_vl8_7fu_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-112-pingjin:m005-0010","start":10,"end":11,"s